  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">PE of the project Support to Education Sector</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This Multiannual Programme Estimate contributes to achieve the objectives of the Financing Agreement SL/FED/037417 &apos;Support to the Education Sector in Sierra Leone&apos;. Overall goal is for children to have equitable access to high quality learning in Sierra Leone, in line with national policies and targets.The Programme Estimate supports the fulfillment of Specific Objectives 1, 2 and 4 of the FA:S.O.1: To Strenghten education system management,S.O.2: To Improve primary school teaching and learning,S.O.4: To improve equitable access to secondary education.</narrative>
  </description>
